# Hosted read-serving image (Linux, Cloud Run). Base runtime + the two Google clients used by sdbackend/cloud and
# the Firestore serving state. Deliberately NO mlx/mlx-*, pyobjc/Vision/Quartz, google-genai or model weights:
# the serving container never runs a model or OCR.
-r base.in
google-cloud-storage
google-cloud-firestore
